OL,3,GNEWSA'We must keep going' says charity
OL,4,Ahit by fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and charities are being hit
OL,7,Fby spiralling fuel prices caused by the
OL,8,FIran war.
OL,10,FLast week, diesel prices reached an
OL,11,Fall-time high and are now about #2 a
OL,12,Flitre after rising more than 40% since
OL,13,Fthe end of February, with petrol prices
OL,14,Fclimbing nearly 34% in that period.
OL,16,FBBC analysis has identified the most
OL,17,Fexpensive fuel stations across the
OL,18,FWest, as prices vary across more urban
OL,19,Fand rural areas.
