OL,3,GNEWSA'We must keep going' says charity
OL,4,Ahit by fuel prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Wood, from charity Freewheelers
OL,7,Fwhich delivers medical supplies, said
OL,8,Fit has had to dip into reserves to keep
OL,9,Fafloat. Somerset-based Berry's Coaches
OL,10,Fhas called on the government to freeze
OL,11,Ffuel duty next year after their fuel
OL,12,Fcosts increased by half since the
OL,13,FMiddle East conflict began.
